//
// Theorem 15.3 (Trace Completeness): every coherent trace is
// actualized. The canopy is the unit of persistence, not the
// individual trace.
//
// Corollary 15.5 (Landscape Accessibility): every coherent
// structure is reachable from empty_s through emergent composition.
// empty_s is the root of the persistence fractal.
//
// Theorem 15.6 (Constant-Structure Correspondence): each coherent
// structure has unique structural constants. Two structures with
// identical constants are structurally equivalent.
//
// Derives from: theory.coherence.law0, theory.coherence.law2,
